  "description": {
   "en": "Despite the isolation, she clung to hope and tried to live a quiet life… until her cousin, Sena, spread cruel rumors that led to Tsubaki being imprisoned and detained.\n\nIn a harsh moment, just as she was about to be sold off, Tsubaki couldn’t bear it any longer—she escaped from her dark fate.\n\nBut it wasn’t long before her pursuers caught up to her… and just then, a young noble named Kyo, heir to a prestigious family, appeared to stop them.\n\nAnd he said something completely unexpected:\n“I’ll buy her.”\n\nTsubaki thought this was the beginning of a humiliating and painful life—as a “night servant.”\nBut what awaited her was something she never imagined…\n\nGentle care, kind words, and a love that asked for nothing in return.”"
  },
